# Security, RBAC & audit

## Roles and core permissions
| Role | Core permissions | Restrictions |
|---|---|---|
| Design Head | Create/approve concepts, assign/reassign tasks, run stage tasks (Concept Review / approvals), view KPI/costing, release design | Cannot alter server time events directly |
| Sketch Designer | View assigned sketch tasks, start/hold/resume/end, upload versions, respond to corrections | No final approval or KPI weight editing |
| Punching Designer | Punching tasks, upload EMB/DST files, corrections, stitch metadata | No concept deletion after approval |
| Machine Operator | Sample task execution, machine details, sample output and wastage | No design-level approval |
| Sample Checker | Quality checklist, approve/reject/re-sample, raise correction | No cost master changes |
| Costing Team | Development/standard cost entries, margin review | Cannot mark employee mistakes unless permitted |
| Production Head | View approved designs, production instructions, accept production release | Cannot alter prior design history |
| Admin | Masters, workflow patterns, hold reasons, KPI definitions, role permissions | All admin actions audited |
| Management/Owner | Final approval, analytics and read access to all performance views | Operational edits should be restricted by role |

## Permission codes
`DESIGN_CREATE`, `DESIGN_ASSIGN`, `TASK_EXECUTE`, `TIME_VIEW_TEAM`,
`CORRECTION_RAISE`, `DESIGN_APPROVE`, `COST_VIEW`, `KPI_ADMIN`,
`MASTER_ADMIN`, `PRODUCTION_RELEASE`, `WORKFLOW_OVERRIDE`,
`ERP_FLOOR_OPERATE`, `ERP_SALES_OPERATE`, `ERP_ACCOUNTS_OPERATE`.

## Rules
- Authenticated identity on every API call; never accept `CreatedBy`/
  `EmployeeId` from the client when it can be derived from the token.
- Object-level authorization: validate `DesignId`/`TaskId` against the
  caller's role and org/company/location scope on every request.
- Design list requires pipeline permissions; design detail/files require
  pipeline access or an assigned task on that design (`design-access.ts`).
- Approvals hub navigation is role-code SoD (not matrix-only); stage
  decisions still check `DESIGN_APPROVE` / task ownership where applicable.
- Sensitive cost/KPI screens require extra permissions beyond basic design access.
- Audit: design edits, task state changes, reassignment, correction
  responsibility, approval, cost changes, KPI definition changes, file deletion.
- Never expose physical server file paths in API responses; use signed,
  non-guessable download URLs for confidential design files.
- Apply anti-malware/file-scanning policy to uploads where infrastructure supports it.
- After Roles & Access matrix save, the saving admin session refreshes;
  other users must refresh or re-login for UI nav (APIs always load fresh DB permissions).
